  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.OASISBootLoader v2.0.8\n\nThe OASIS BootLoader provides a single entry point to initialise the entire OASIS ecosystem in any .NET application. Reads OASISDNA configuration, registers and activates all configured providers, sets up Auto-FailOver/LoadBalancing, and returns a ready-to-use OASIS instance. Integrate 55+ decentralised networks into your app with just a few lines of code. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.7\n- Initial validated package contents and metadata for this release line.\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/OASIS Architecture/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.OASISBootLoader",
